// Test-only fixture, deliberately outside the sample workspace.
//
// Two `Pay` tasks the duplicate-name rule would rename, in a file that does
// not parse: one task lost its name and the branch has no label. A repair
// would write back the recovered AST, which drops the branch the parser
// skipped, so the file must stay as written until it parses.

process CutOff for Order {
   task Pay
   task Pay
   task
   gateway G
      -> Pay
}
